  "hero_headline": "AI 自进化时代开启与全球能源政治博弈加剧 / AI Self-Evolution Era Begins and Global Energy Politics Intensifies",
  "daily_overview": "今日全球动态的核心在于技术与权力结构的深度调整。科技领域，「AI 自进化」迈出关键步伐，Claude 模型通过自我训练在研究效率上超越人类，同时端侧轻量化工具调用模型与自动化 Agent 基础设施正重塑开发范式；财经方面，全球能源版图因美委油气协议发生巨变，加之大型光伏企业业绩承压，资本市场正加速向医疗等 AI 替代性板块寻求避险；时政层面，地缘政治冲突持续引发人道主义危机与社会动荡，从尼泊尔灾后重建到以色列囚犯待遇争议，全球治理面临严峻考验。整体看，技术效率的极度优化与全球资源分配的激烈争夺已成为左右未来的双引擎。\n\nToday's global landscape is defined by profound structural shifts. In technology, AI self-evolution makes a breakthrough with Claude models outperforming human researchers, while lightweight on-device agents redefine software development. Financially, the global energy map is reshaped by the US-Venezuela oil agreement, as solar firms face losses and capital pivots toward pharmaceutical hedges. Geopolitically, ongoing conflicts trigger humanitarian crises, from Nepal's post-flood collapse to prison disputes in Israel, testing global stability. Technology's efficiency gains and the intense competition for resources now act as the dual engines driving our future.",
